@startuml C1_Incident_Types_Scenario_View
title C1 – Incident Types (Scenario View)

left to right direction
skinparam usecase {
  BorderColor Black
  BackgroundColor HoneyDew
  ArrowColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator
rectangle "Port Logistics Management System (PLMS)" as System {
  usecase "List Incident Types" as UC_List
  usecase "Search / Filter Types" as UC_Search
  usecase "Create Incident Type" as UC_Create
  usecase "Edit Incident Type" as UC_Edit
  usecase "Delete Incident Type" as UC_Delete
  usecase "View Type Hierarchy" as UC_Tree
}

Operator --> UC_List
Operator --> UC_Search
Operator --> UC_Create
Operator --> UC_Edit
Operator --> UC_Delete
Operator --> UC_Tree

note right of UC_Tree
  Operators can visualise parent/child
  relationships for categorisation.
end note

@enduml
